{"id":"fd4ded42af655de9","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-supportprojectionextension.md","title":"A support set constructs an extension independent of all omitted variables","display":"thm-supportprojectionextension — A support set constructs an extension independent of all omitted variables","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-supportprojectionextension","aliases":["27-thm-supportprojectionextension"],"display":"thm-supportprojectionextension — A support set constructs an extension independent of all omitted variables","depends_on":["[[27-df-supportset]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.2 Support sets","source_printed_pages":"515–516","source_pdf_pages":"539–540","verification_status":"source-definition-and-projection-construction-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-supportprojectionextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-supportprojectionextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supportprojectionextension — A support set constructs an extension independent of all omitted variables"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"162ba4b092f14c5b\" href=\"?note=162ba4b092f14c5b\" title=\"27-df-supportset\">27-df-supportset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.2 Support sets"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"515–516"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"539–540"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-projection-construction-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"162ba4b092f14c5b\" href=\"?note=162ba4b092f14c5b\" title=\"27-df-supportset\">27-df-supportset</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^S\">\\(\\mathbb B^S\\)</span> 为S上的布尔赋值集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_S\">\\(\\pi_S\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_S:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^S,\\qquad\\pi_S(x)\\coloneqq x|_S\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_S:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^S,\\qquad\\pi_S(x)\\coloneqq x|_S\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g:\\mathbb B^S\\to\\mathbb B\\;(g\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g:\\mathbb B^S\\to\\mathbb B\\;(g\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g_S\\coloneqq\\{(y,1)\\mid y\\in\\pi_S[T]\\}\\cup\\{(y,0)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^S\\setminus\\pi_S[T]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g_S\\coloneqq\\{(y,1)\\mid y\\in\\pi_S[T]\\}\\cup\\{(y,0)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^S\\setminus\\pi_S[T]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(g_S\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x|_S=y|_S\\Rightarrow g_S(x|_S)=g_S(y|_S))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(g_S\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x|_S=y|_S\\Rightarrow g_S(x|_S)=g_S(y|_S))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.2.2，印刷 pp.515–516／PDF pp.539–540。本地把“省略变量冗余”展开为明确因子函数。两类投影不交时示性函数在T为1、F为0；反向同一投影若同时有真假样本，任何g都会矛盾。S为空时赋值域仍有唯一元素；仅当样本至多一侧非空时它可作支持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-supportset","status":"resolved","id":"162ba4b092f14c5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-supportset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-supportset","status":"resolved","id":"162ba4b092f14c5b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-supportset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\mathbb B^S$ 为S上的布尔赋值集，$\\pi_S$ 由下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-supportset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\mathbb B^S$ 为S上的布尔赋值集，$\\pi_S$ 由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_S:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^S,\\qquad\\pi_S(x)\\coloneqq x|_S\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g:\\mathbb B^S\\to\\mathbb B\\;(g\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)).","display":true},{"tex":"g_S\\coloneqq\\{(y,1)\\mid y\\in\\pi_S[T]\\}\\cup\\{(y,0)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^S\\setminus\\pi_S[T]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(g_S\\circ\\pi_S\\in\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x|_S=y|_S\\Rightarrow g_S(x|_S)=g_S(y|_S))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1951,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-supportprojectionextension|thm-supportprojectionextension — A support set constructs an extension independent of all omitted variables]]"}],"outgoing":["162ba4b092f14c5b","2080bf803b294b75"]}